<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia 2007 T-bond yld averages 6.508 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia 2007 T-bond yld averages 6.508 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of today's A$500 million T-bond tender, announced by Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA):</p>
<p>  Stock	  Offering     Allotted	Avg yield   Range</p>
<p>  10.0 Oct 07  AS200 million    A$201 million     6.508    6.50-6.51</p>
<p>		   (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 39)</p>
<p>  Stock	  Offering     Allotted	Avg yield   Range</p>
<p>  7.50 Sep 09  AS300 million    A$300.758 million  6.597    6.58-6.50</p>
<p>		   (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 98)</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
